8249       ;
8250       proc icphreg data=hiv;
8251       class Stage Dose / desc;
8252       model (Left, Right) = Stage Dose;
8253       run;

NOTE: The option BASEHAZ of the MODEL statement was not specified. Fitting the model with a constant baseline hazard with 5 segments.
